{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33167","headline":"古边卒思归 · 司马扎","name":"古边卒思归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有田不得耕，身卧辽阳城。\n梦中稻花香，觉後战血腥。\n汉武在深殿，唯思廓寰瀛。\n中原半烽火，此屋皆点行。\n边土无膏腴，闲地何必争。\n徒令执耒者，刀下死纵横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}